- **Candidate**: {{ candidate_name }} ({{ candidate_email }})
- **Role**: {{ role }}
- **Department**: {{ department }}
- **Company/Plan**: {{ company }}
- **Decision**: {{ decision }}
- **Feedback Tone**: {{ feedback_tone }}
{% if offer_details %}
## Offer Details
- **Designation**: {{ offer_details.designation }}
{% if offer_details.ctc %}- **CTC**: {{ offer_details.ctc }}{% endif %}
{% if offer_details.joiningDate %}- **Joining Date**: {{ offer_details.joiningDate }}{% endif %}
